                <mxCell id="logical-note" value="Question: can a cover request exist without a shift and two staff? No. Each cover request has exactly one shift, one requester, and one colleague; a shift or a staff member can have none or many.&lt;br&gt;Source: build-spec.md Glossary, Domain model, and States and lifecycle. Red rows are personal data. Proposed. It does not test the schema, performance, or retention." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
