                <mxCell id="physical-note" value="Question: what does this slice add to the roster database? One new table, cover_request. ward, staff, and shift already exist and stay unchanged.&lt;br&gt;Conventions follow the existing schema in this example: snake_case, bigint identity keys, timestamptz. UQ enforces BR3, one waiting request per shift. IX serves SC3 Requests to me.&lt;br&gt;decline_reason is personal: proposed retention 12 months, owner ward manager (Q2). Every choice here is proposed. No SQL or migration is written; it does not test performance or a safe migration." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
